# A dossier is a map of where somebody lives and sleeps: coordinates, dates,
# filenames, and copies of the originals. `evidence` writes here by default.
evidence/
coords.json

# `series review` writes a page of coordinates and dates from your own photos.
# The page saves the answers, wherever the browser puts them, as the last of these.
review/
review-*.json
review-*.html
series-answers*.json

# The page of `trips review` saves the answers about your stays under this name.
trips-answers*.json

# `share` writes cards with your name and face on them. Post them yourself.
share/

# Your own account's work: tracks, caches, plans, logs, applied records.
# Never goes to GitHub. See workspace/WORKSPACE.md.
workspace/

# `history` writes a dated movement history: where you were, day by day.
history/
